l><p>Association is significant at <italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.0005 (Bonferroni correction for 108 comparisons).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Associations between selected autoimmune conditions and myelodysplastic syndrome and chronic myeloid disorder with exclusions of time intervals before diagnosis/selection</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="char" char="("/><col align="char" char="("/><col align="char" char="("/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</th><th colspan="3" align="center" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50"><bold>Time interval before diagnosis/control selection evaluated for autoimmune conditions</bold></th></tr><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</th><th align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50"><bold>&#x0003e;1 year</bold></th><th align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50"><bold>&#x0003e;2 years</bold></th><th align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50"><bold>&#x0003e;5 years</bold></th></tr><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Myeloid subtype and autoimmune condition</bold></th><th align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50"><bold>OR (95&#x00025; CI)<sup>a</sup></bold></th><th align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50"><bold>OR (95&#x00025; CI)<sup>a</sup></bold></th><th align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50"><bold>OR (95&#x00025; CI)<sup>a</sup></bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td colspan="4" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Myelodysplastic syndrome</italic></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Rheumatoid arthritis</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50"><underline>1.52 (1.27&#x02013;1.81)</underline></td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50"><underline>